stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested : reader requests article

    Requested --> PaymentRequired : no valid payment attached, gateway returns HTTP 402

    PaymentRequired --> PaymentPending : reader submits signed EIP-3009 authorization

    PaymentPending --> Verified : facilitator /verify succeeds
    PaymentPending --> Rejected : facilitator /verify fails

    Verified --> Delivered : wallet already owns article
    Verified --> Delivered : facilitator /settle succeeds
    Verified --> Rejected : facilitator /settle fails

    Rejected --> PaymentRequired : reader retries payment

    Delivered --> [*] : article served (HTTP 200)